    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "The ore crusher with a hopper chain: the top chest holds raw iron, which the hopper under it puts into the crusher's top (its input); the chest beside it holds coal, which the hopper below it puts into the crusher's side (its fuel); the hopper under the crusher takes the iron ingots from its bottom (its output) into the chest at the foot. Place it with /place template msm_examples:ore_crusher_line ~ ~ ~ and watch the bottom chest fill.",
